---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field id string UUID of the visual review run to look the snapshot up from. This is a run id, not the `id` of a snapshot inside that run. The run supplies the repo and run type to search, so the `identifier` query parameter is required alongside it.
---@field identifier string Identifier of the snapshot to look up, for example a Storybook story id plus theme. Read it from the `identifier` field of a snapshot in the run. It is a name rather than a UUID, and it is required in addition to the run id in the path.
