---@class posthog.visual_review.QuarantineLiftEntry
---@field id string UUID of the lift request.
---@field quarantine_id string UUID of the quarantine event this request lifts. A later quarantine of the same snapshot is a different event.
---@field identifier string Snapshot identifier under quarantine.
---@field run_type string Run type of the quarantine, for example storybook.
---@field pr_number number Pull request whose merge the lift waits for.
---@field expected_hash string Content hash a default-branch run must render, against a baseline entry with the same hash, for the lift to apply.
---@field state posthog.visual_review.QuarantineLiftStateEnum `pending` waits for the merge and a matching default-branch run. `applied` lifted the quarantine. `cancelled` was withdrawn, or the pull request closed without merging into the run's branch. `superseded` means the quarantine ended some other way, or another request lifted it. * `pending` - pending * `applied` - applied * `cancelled` - cancelled * `superseded` - superseded
---@field detail string The latest verification outcome, in plain words.
---@field created_at string When the lift was requested.
---@field updated_at string When the request last changed.
---@field resolved_at? string|distilled.Null When the request left `pending`. Null while it waits.
---@field source_run_id? string|distilled.Null Run the lift was requested from. Null after that run is deleted.
---@field requested_by? posthog.visual_review.UserBasicInfo|distilled.Null User who requested the lift, or on whose behalf an agent did.
---@field merge_commit_sha? string|distilled.Null Merge commit of the pull request. Set when the lift applies.
---@field lifted_at_sha? string|distilled.Null Commit of the default-branch run that proved the fix and lifted the quarantine. A branch that does not contain it still treats the snapshot as quarantined.
---@field source string Who requested the lift: `human` for a person in the UI, `agent` for an agent through MCP.

---* `pending` - pending
---* `applied` - applied
---* `cancelled` - cancelled
---* `superseded` - superseded
---@alias posthog.visual_review.QuarantineLiftStateEnum "pending"|"applied"|"cancelled"|"superseded"

